      "writtenOn": "2020-01-07T15:19:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. I agree with your point. The MBP associated with ANI/PON side should have element of tp_id in its entity-id, because we create one MBP per tp-id. The MBP associated with UNI should not have tp-id element in its entity-id and is created once only.. \nThis needs to be ensured.",
      "parentUuid": "23f1a703_6de3bda2",
      "revId": "44bd6dcbe053b338968870d6148d798b6458b582",
