      "writtenOn": "2020-01-07T10:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t this a problem if we need to do multiple VLAN match-action in the EVTO table? We are deleting the old entity altogether and re-create again. \nFor AT\u0026T workflow this may not be an issue.",
      "revId": "44bd6dcbe053b338968870d6148d798b6458b582",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
